msgstr ""
"Kthena 中提供了一个具体示例：[prefill-decode-"
"disaggregation.yaml](https://github.com/volcano-"
"sh/kthena/blob/main/examples/model-serving/prefill-decode-"
"disaggregation.yaml)。"

msgid ""
"For more advanced features, please refer to the "
"[Kthena](https://kthena.volcano.sh/)."
msgstr "如需了解更多高级功能，请参阅 [Kthena](https://kthena.volcano.sh/)。"

msgid ""
"- A namespace for the example resources. The manifests below use `dev`, "
"create it if it does not exist:"
msgstr "- 用于存放示例资源的命名空间。下面的清单使用 `dev`，如果该命名空间不存在请先创建："

msgid "The key vLLM-Ascend launch arguments are summarized below."
msgstr "下表汇总了 vLLM-Ascend 的关键启动参数。"

msgid "| Argument | Value in this example | Description |"
msgstr "| 参数 | 本示例中的取值 | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| `--served-model-name` | `deepseek-ai/DeepSeekV2` | Model name exposed by "
"the OpenAI-compatible API. It must match `spec.model` of `ModelServer` and "
"`spec.modelName` of `ModelRoute`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--served-model-name` | `deepseek-ai/DeepSeekV2` | 通过 OpenAI 兼容 API "
"对外暴露的模型名称。它必须与 `ModelServer` 的 `spec.model` 以及 `ModelRoute` 的 "
"`spec.modelName` 保持一致。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--tensor-parallel-size` | `2` | Tensor parallelism degree, i.e. every "
"layer is sharded across 2 NPUs. It must match `tp_size` in "
"`kv_connector_extra_config`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--tensor-parallel-size` | `2` | 张量并行度，即每一层都被切分到 2 个 NPU 上。它必须与 "
"`kv_connector_extra_config` 中的 `tp_size` 保持一致。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--gpu-memory-utilization` | `0.8` | Fraction of NPU memory reserved for "
"model weights and KV cache. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--gpu-memory-utilization` | `0.8` | 预留给模型权重和 KV cache 的 NPU 显存比例。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-model-len` | `8192` | Maximum context length, counting both input "
"and generated tokens. |"
msgstr "| `--max-model-len` | `8192` | 最大上下文长度，同时计入输入 token 和生成的 token。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--max-num-batched-tokens` | `8192` (prefill) / `16384` (decode) | Upper "
"bound of tokens processed in one iteration. A larger value improves "
"throughput but consumes more memory. |"
msgstr ""
"| `--max-num-batched-tokens` | `8192`（prefill）/ `16384`（decode） | 单次迭代处理的 "
"token 数上限。取值越大，吞吐越高，但占用的内存也更多。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--enforce-eager` | - | Disables graph capture, which reduces memory usage"
" at the cost of some performance. |"
msgstr "| `--enforce-eager` | - | 禁用图捕获，可减少内存占用，但会损失一定的性能。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--trust-remote-code` | - | Allows loading the custom modeling code "
"shipped with the model. |"
msgstr "| `--trust-remote-code` | - | 允许加载模型自带的自定义建模代码。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--no-enable-prefix-caching` | decode only | Disables prefix caching on "
"the decode side so that more memory is available for the received KV cache. "
"|"
msgstr ""
"| `--no-enable-prefix-caching` | 仅 decode | 在 decode 侧禁用前缀缓存，从而为接收到的 KV "
"cache 腾出更多内存。 |"

msgid ""
"| `--kv-transfer-config` | JSON string | KV cache transfer configuration, "
"see the table below. |"
msgstr "| `--kv-transfer-config` | JSON 字符串 | KV cache 传输配置，参见下表。 |"

msgid "The fields of `--kv-transfer-config` are:"
msgstr "`--kv-transfer-config` 的字段如下："

msgid "| Field | Value in this example | Description |"
msgstr "| 字段 | 本示例中的取值 | 说明 |"

msgid ""
"| `kv_connector` | `MooncakeConnectorV1` | Connector implementation provided"
" by vLLM-Ascend. In Kthena the `mooncake` and `nixl` router types share the "
"same implementation, so either works; this example uses `mooncake` to mirror"
" the name configured here. |"
msgstr ""
"| `kv_connector` | `MooncakeConnectorV1` | 由 vLLM-Ascend 提供的 Connector 实现。在 "
"Kthena 中，`mooncake` 和 `nixl` 两种路由类型共用同一实现，因此两者均可；本示例使用 "
"`mooncake`，以与此处配置的名称保持一致。 |"

msgid ""
"| `kv_buffer_device` | `npu` | Device on which the KV cache buffers are "
"allocated (`npu` for Ascend). |"
msgstr "| `kv_buffer_device` | `npu` | 分配 KV cache 缓冲区的设备（在昇腾上为 `npu`）。 |"

msgid ""
"| `kv_role` | `kv_producer` (prefill) / `kv_consumer` (decode) | Role in a "
"PD pair: the prefill instance produces and sends KV cache, while the decode "
"instance consumes it. |"
msgstr ""
"| `kv_role` | `kv_producer`（prefill）/ `kv_consumer`（decode） | 在 PD "
"对中的角色：prefill 实例生成并发送 KV cache，decode 实例则消费它。 |"

msgid ""
"| `kv_rank` | `0` (prefill) / `1` (decode) | Rank identifying each instance "
"of the PD group, so that both sides can be distinguished. |"
msgstr ""
"| `kv_rank` | `0`（prefill）/ `1`（decode） | 用于标识 PD 组中各个实例的 rank，以便区分两端。 |"

msgid ""
"| `kv_parallel_size` | `1` | Number of KV-transfer instances started per "
"role; `1` because each role runs a single instance here. |"
msgstr ""
"| `kv_parallel_size` | `1` | 每个角色启动的 KV 传输实例数量；此处每个角色只运行一个实例，因此为 `1`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `kv_port` | `20001` (prefill) / `20002` (decode) | Port used for the KV "
"cache transfer handshake. It must be reachable between the prefill and "
"decode Pods and be unique for each role. |"
msgstr ""
"| `kv_port` | `20001`（prefill）/ `20002`（decode） | 用于 KV cache 传输握手的端口。该端口在 "
"prefill Pod 与 decode Pod 之间必须可达，且每个角色的端口必须唯一。 |"

msgid ""
"| `kv_connector_extra_config` | `prefill`/`decode` with `dp_size` and "
"`tp_size` | Topology of both sides known to the connector. It must match the"
" actual data-parallel and tensor-parallel settings of the deployment. |"
msgstr ""
"| `kv_connector_extra_config` | 带 `dp_size` 和 `tp_size` 的 `prefill`/`decode`"
" | Connector 所了解的两端拓扑。它必须与部署实际的数据并行和张量并行设置保持一致。 |"
